  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterCasino3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Sir Beast?
  - "Are you\u2026 crying? Um\u2026 I should probably go\u2014"
  - " I\u2019m not crying! It\u2019s just\u2026 you see\u2026 Ellain\u0430 and I\u2026
    we made up. And right now I\u2019m\u2026 really happy. "
  - "God\u2026 you sound less like you\u2019re forty-two and more like you\u2019re
    sixty-seven. Crying like somebody\u2019s grandfather\u2026"
  - "You don\u2019t understand\u2026 She came to me first. And apologized first.
    For the first time in her life. I\u2019ve never been this happy before\u2026"
  - "Hm. I guess that actually is an achievement. Though it\u2019s weird considering
    we discussed this almost a week ago and she only apologized today."
  - 'She always needed a long time to find the right words. '
  - "Yeah, I noticed. But, um\u2026 Sir Beast?"
  - "Yes? What is it, se\xF1orita?"
  - "I can already tell you\u2019re preparing for Spain\u2026 huh. I wanted to ask
    \u2014 once we\u2019re there, and once I figure out where to go\u2026 will we
    stay in touch?"
  - 'Of course! '
  - "Aren\u2019t we close friends now? Wanna become the godmother of my future child? "
  - "You really are a master of bizarrely timed proposals\u2026 Thanks, but I\u2019ll
    pass. I hate children\u2026.ew\u2026"
  - "HA-HA! I\u2019m joking. You should\u2019ve seen your face \u2014 priceless!!!!It\u2019s
    way too early for me to think about kids anyway. First I need a job. But\u2026
    Ellaina always dreamed of having a golden retriever."
  - ' I agree to be the godmother of the retriever.  '
  - "Now that\u2019s a proper answer!"
  - "It\u2019s weird how easily you switch from crying to laughing and talking about
    dogs\u2026 damn\u2026Spanish thing i guess\u2026"
